ce/alignment/completeness issues)\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJM2TCM0Y1NCBBZ9JZTKW183\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T06:54:20.288Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"Submitted for review in PR #622: https://github.com/kynetic-ai/kynetic-spec/pull/622 (branch fix/web-ui-websocket-reconnect-race, commit 155276ca9). Implemented WebSocketManager stale-close race guard and intentional-disconnect reconnect suppression with regression coverage in tests/websocket-manager.test.ts. Verification: npx vitest run tests/websocket-manager.test.ts (3 passed). Full npm test and kspec validate still show pre-existing unrelated baseline failures/issues (cli-serve no-projects assertion, session-note-limit timeouts, existing validate schema/reference/alignment/completeness warnings/errors).\",\"supersedes\":null},{\"_ulid\":\"01KJM385VE2C92BYG0GM4HK06T\",\"created_at\":\"2026-03-01T07:01:52.110Z\",\"author\":\"Jacob Chapel\",\"content\":\"[FIX_CYCLE: 1] Review findings: MUST-FIX: PR #622 failed regression gate. npm test reports 3 failures (tests/cli-serve.test.ts foreground startup assertion; tests/cli/session-note-limit.test.ts two timeout failures). Review posted with inline comment; do not merge until full suite is green.\",\"supersedes\":null}],\"todos\":[],\"automation\":\"eligible\",\"_sourceFile\":\"/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec/.kspec/project.tasks.yaml\"}}\n","status":"completed"}